  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.32.s1",
      "source_sha256": "e6bd1612dfe71ff6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] they argue in doubt [?] [about] the Son of God; truly [he] said [?] to his [?] seek [?] born of God, as is read [?]; then he himself foretold about him [?], said, and you [?] of the place [?] to him [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.32.s2",
      "source_sha256": "f7643c8502ca821b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] him, the Son [?] dead [?] when the Lord ruled [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.32.s3",
      "source_sha256": "da9062dbd837bbee",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] to all [?], himself sent [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.33.s1",
      "source_sha256": "27cf554d2038cf71",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] [he] showed himself afterward again in the sight of men."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.33.s2",
      "source_sha256": "629277d0c5a7e299",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "About this same sending Isaiah [?] also [spoke] more openly [?] the same [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.33.s3",
      "source_sha256": "2d1a6580bd1862fe",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] he then made firm [?]; he said:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.33.s4",
      "source_sha256": "09a1624455ce72b7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] paying back recompense to his [enemies] [?], that is, to the same Jewish people, of whom the prophet also said: \"Before she gave birth"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.33.s5",
      "source_sha256": "0ef12e95269e3d65",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and before [the pain] came upon her [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.33.s6",
      "source_sha256": "5800924d416f5e16",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] man [?] made known [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.33.s7",
      "source_sha256": "057b607b52e6442a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "As the same prophet [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.33.s8",
      "source_sha256": "ebeb2e65569a5e21",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "should say [?]: Before the virgin bore Christ the Son, [he was] in his divinity; before the virgin's time came, [he had] in himself [?] no beginning of any times."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.33.s9",
      "source_sha256": "a8b7080f936dff7c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "About this the prophet then says afterward: \"Who has heard, or who has seen, anything like this, or anything at all among men that is like it?\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.33.s10",
      "source_sha256": "8f902d8e5712426c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.33.s11",
      "source_sha256": "c7f8fa8145494efe",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "\"Shall I [cause] others to be born [and] [?] [not] bear [?] myself?\" said the Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.33.s12",
      "source_sha256": "2132325e0e364cc7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "\"And I who grant to others"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.33.s13",
      "source_sha256": "c4409701fe46cfdc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to bear [?], shall I be [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.33.s14",
      "source_sha256": "c8297e85a7d48b9d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] of all this testimony [?], it is [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.33.s15",
      "source_sha256": "ace447af11be4f3b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] does not believe [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.33.s16",
      "source_sha256": "e3f094f7ca36d8a9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] that for him [one of] two [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.33.s17",
      "source_sha256": "53ba4a367f8e7d05",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[he must] choose: either to believe in the Son, or [to call] false the prophets who foretold this. About this it says: HERE [IS SHOWN] HOW CHRIST WAS BORN OF THE FATHER INEXPRESSIBLY, BEFORE THE FIRST CREATION. Many are asking at what time the Son of God was born, though he is ever-existing, as is written about him: \"His [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s1",
      "source_sha256": "593742a396aa34d4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The almighty Father made this Christ known through Isaiah, although he spoke before under the name of Cyrus, [saying] that he is God"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s2",
      "source_sha256": "2c9efd97cbebf649",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and Lord: \"Thus said the Lord to my Christ, Cyrus, whose right hand I have taken, that I may bow nations before his face, and I will turn the backs of kings to him, and I will open the doors"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s3",
      "source_sha256": "c9ad8b98ec832476",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "before him,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s4",
      "source_sha256": "3f2a6d4c863d3701",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and the gates will not be shut. I will go before you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s5",
      "source_sha256": "c503028dbac3c1e1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and subdue [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s6",
      "source_sha256": "e4695c1288202a4e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "…for you the glorious ones of the earth [?]. I will shatter the bronze gates, I will break the iron bars, and I will give you the hidden treasure."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s7",
      "source_sha256": "a58838cb72d709d8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And I want you to understand holy mysteries, for I am the Lord who names you, the God of Israel. In this name, Cyrus,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s8",
      "source_sha256": "980f0c6cdb28efc1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Christ is certainly foretold,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s9",
      "source_sha256": "3f534f0222d73d6c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "before whom the"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s10",
      "source_sha256": "8fbdfc40774b533d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "peoples"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s11",
      "source_sha256": "9652e8391c3d6f9e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and kingdoms bowed"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s12",
      "source_sha256": "0b65c0f1d31808e1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "in faith. Otherwise, no one in the kingdom of Israel was ever named Cyrus."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s13",
      "source_sha256": "fd36f049a300e9ff",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If, then, anyone believes that by Cyrus,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s14",
      "source_sha256": "a2c060aa4ead9d30",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "king of the Persians, it is foretold,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s15",
      "source_sha256": "a0a2ebf25fa71e00",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "let him recognize"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s16",
      "source_sha256": "5a11d966a24b88ca",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that it is contrary and heathenish for any man to believe that the impious man"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s17",
      "source_sha256": "72864b8c005ac8b8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and the heathen"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s18",
      "source_sha256": "be1aeccb86002aca",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to idols"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s19",
      "source_sha256": "ef21c00ec78afeb9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "worshipper should be called Christ,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s20",
      "source_sha256": "93c65ec59f740c02",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "God and Lord"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s21",
      "source_sha256": "e02c3ef467ea1401",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "was"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s22",
      "source_sha256": "4228ea7af59822ab",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "named. Moreover, concerning this, it is not"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s23",
      "source_sha256": "1a037a17d36e1efd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so written in the translation of the Seventy, 'to my Christ Cyrus'; rather, they write: 'Thus said the Lord to my Christ the Lord.' And that is now, without doubt,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s24",
      "source_sha256": "a7bd2ba9daefca97",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as clear as light to understand,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s25",
      "source_sha256": "c38f30151e42d4fe",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that this is said in"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s26",
      "source_sha256": "9ce2d7c759030c46",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the name of our Lord. If Christ"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s27",
      "source_sha256": "0460e5a2bf25e25e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "is not God,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s28",
      "source_sha256": "8e843ff5854327dc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "let the unbelievers now tell us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s29",
      "source_sha256": "1160725cf25342f3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to whom God was speaking"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s30",
      "source_sha256": "bd60b12345bdf319",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "in Genesis, where"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s31",
      "source_sha256": "3a9b630cceeb8545",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "he"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s32",
      "source_sha256": "6e369e7166c416e8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "said: \"Let us make man in our image and in our likeness.\" As is also said thereafter: \"And God created man in the image"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s33",
      "source_sha256": "fe5738036d967b8f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "and likeness of God; he made him.\" Let us now seek"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s34",
      "source_sha256": "212ca935cacaa0ad",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "then which God created"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s35",
      "source_sha256": "380472cbbb804146",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "or in whose divinity God made man in the image"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s36",
      "source_sha256": "76fb05e8f7ca4bb4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "he"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s37",
      "source_sha256": "38ef99c3b18307d1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "created. If they answer and say: \"in that of the angels,\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.34.s38",
      "source_sha256": "229dbb89acc73c39",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "yet an angel is not equally like God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s1",
      "source_sha256": "64b4d86de74a0b4e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "[I lift my] hand over them, and they shall become plunder for those who formerly served them;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s2",
      "source_sha256": "a9aff89b24a9db07",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "and you shall know that the Lord of hosts has sent me.\" Now whose can this voice"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s3",
      "source_sha256": "e05350113f26c53d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "be, if not the Saviour's,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s4",
      "source_sha256": "c8fdd6afccf15f91",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "the Lord's, who, though almighty God, made himself known as sent by the almighty"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s5",
      "source_sha256": "a7cfb59abbc73e92",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Father? So he was certainly sent to the peoples"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s6",
      "source_sha256": "89a6110383ddd0a0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "according to his divine glory, which he previously had together"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s7",
      "source_sha256": "4b980b75d546d739",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "with the Father,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s8",
      "source_sha256": "dd149c450e1b79ef",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "when he emptied himself and a servant's"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s9",
      "source_sha256": "19c0d45d7a344bc2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "form took on, became obedient"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s10",
      "source_sha256": "a17a5ff535509187",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "unto death."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s11",
      "source_sha256": "a5427e0ccc4488dd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "The same one also said, following after this: \"Praise and rejoice, daughter of Zion, for behold, I come"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s12",
      "source_sha256": "3c9bd42bdcf0e175",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "and in your midst"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s13",
      "source_sha256": "3f6f3b80529f3753",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "I will dwell, says the Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s14",
      "source_sha256": "101f92bf16263a2e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "And on that day"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s15",
      "source_sha256": "89efa82a622271e2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "many nations shall be gathered to the Lord,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s16",
      "source_sha256": "75da65c03b193ce0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "and they shall become my people, and I will dwell in your midst."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s17",
      "source_sha256": "37ac931b971a828e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "And you shall know that the Lord of hosts has sent me to you.\" Who, then, is this Lord [sent] by the Lord of hosts"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s18",
      "source_sha256": "e26bc52e1cacf21e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "…was sent, if not again the same Lord, the Savior Christ? Moreover, it was also [shown] here earlier about the Holy Spirit, about his divinity:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s19",
      "source_sha256": "51c08d9014b9d1ed",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "and that"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s20",
      "source_sha256": "3a9b630cceeb8545",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "he"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s21",
      "source_sha256": "c67ac85f880bb977",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "is the Spirit of God, as Job said: \"The Spirit of the Lord"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s22",
      "source_sha256": "6b17da0fa9f4340c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "made me, and the breath of the Almighty gave me life.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s23",
      "source_sha256": "6fc2801e9d31a336",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "\"Behold, God himself made me just as he made you.\" Concerning the same one of whom he had indeed said earlier: \"The Spirit of the Lord"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s24",
      "source_sha256": "ff63d725e7251ffc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "made me.\" That he then joined"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s25",
      "source_sha256": "915d5cfd4c38391b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "to God, where he"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s26",
      "source_sha256": "9b408df0a8dbd3cd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "afterwards said: \"Behold, God made me just as he made you,\" so that he"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s27",
      "source_sha256": "13cd45f77501fc5e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "made known that this same Spirit is God. Here it speaks of the indication of the three persons of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s28",
      "source_sha256": "96320d6fcbaf5a07",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "It is shown"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s29",
      "source_sha256": "3c88d080dbca2179",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "in the books of the Old Testament that the Father"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.35.s30",
      "source_sha256": "ff4e4bd9f286647c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "and the Son and the Holy Spirit are God. Yet the Jewish people do not believe this, that the Son and the Holy Spirit are God"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s1",
      "source_sha256": "556c38c2dec3db01",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "and will be"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s2",
      "source_sha256": "e89a2fb74b024c1b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "name"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s3",
      "source_sha256": "4b1dab3229477d54",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "called"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s4",
      "source_sha256": "780e90ee5b5a6c92",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "Father"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s5",
      "source_sha256": "09caa4e0fecef498",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "of the age to come"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s6",
      "source_sha256": "8c99bd9e96235d4d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "his rule will be multiplied"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s7",
      "source_sha256": "a48253b6cd9145f5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "The prophet indeed [said] \"was born\": not born for himself when he became man, [but] born for us. \"Son,\" moreover,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "rea/monsee-isidor#Mons.36.s8",
      "source_sha256": "d4fb42afdcb6e14c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-02",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "if not the Son of God? \"His lordship [is upon his shoulder]\" because [?] on his own [?], because Pilate wrote the title of his [?] above his head."
    }
  ]
}
